  "title": "Hilltop Holdings Inc. Announces Financial Results for Fourth Quarter and Full Year 2025",
  "summary": "Hilltop Holdings Inc. (NYSE: HTH) (“Hilltop”) today announced financial results for the fourth quarter and full year 2025. Hilltop produced income attributable to common stockholders of $41.6 million, or $0.69 per diluted share, for the fourth quarter of 2025, compared to $35.5 million, or $0.55 per diluted share, for the fourth quarter of 2024. Income attributable to common stockholders for the full year 2025 was $165.6 million, or $2.64 per diluted share, compared to $113.2 million, or $1.74 p",
